1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,538
Now the pendulum swings back.

2
00:00:01,962 --> 00:00:03,150
The destruction stops,

3
00:00:03,338 --> 00:00:04,675
and creation begins.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,225
Stone by stone,

5
00:00:06,512 --> 00:00:09,200
the crumbling corners of the facade are realigned,

6
00:00:09,588 --> 00:00:11,462
and fresh mortar seals the wounds.

7
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:14,763
Up top, the skeletal roofline is crowned again

8
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:16,625
with solid timber and heavy,

9
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:17,612
dark slate.

10
00:00:18,062 --> 00:00:20,800
For decades, the silhouette was jagged against the

11
00:00:20,812 --> 00:00:21,375
horizon.

12
00:00:21,788 --> 00:00:22,850
Suddenly, it is whole.

13
00:00:23,262 --> 00:00:25,312
Inside, the grand staircase,

14
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,138
once a hazard of rotting wood,

15
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:28,975
is rebuilt in rich,

16
00:00:29,212 --> 00:00:30,075
dark mahogany.

17
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:33,062
Fresh plaster glides over the exposed brick,

18
00:00:33,375 --> 00:00:35,712
erasing the water stains like a deep wound

19
00:00:35,725 --> 00:00:37,388
healing in fast forward.

20
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,888
Even the air changes.

21
00:00:39,312 --> 00:00:41,100
The damp smell of decay gives way to

22
00:00:41,112 --> 00:00:42,775
cut wood, fresh paint,

23
00:00:43,088 --> 00:00:43,962
and raw potential.

24
00:00:44,375 --> 00:00:45,388
The house is waking up.
